```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: "servletresponse-writer-xss"
  kind: taint
  severity: ERROR
  message: "Cross-site scripting detected in HttpServletResponse writer with variable '$VAR'. User input was detected going directly from the HttpServletRequest into output. Ensure your data is properly encoded using org.owasp.encoder.Encode.forHtml: 'Encode.forHtml($VAR)'."
  metadata:
    language: java
    category: security
    cwe: "CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')"
    owasp:
      - "A07:2017 - Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)"
      - "A03:2021 - Injection"

sources:
  - id: HTTP_PARAM
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: javax.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest
        method: getParameter

sinks:
  - id: RESPONSE_WRITER
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: javax.servlet.http.HttpServletResponse
        method: getWriter.write

propagations:
  - id: PARAM_TO_WRITER
    edge: arg->param
    kind: taint
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "sinks节点api.method定义不正确，原始规则匹配的是getWriter()方法及其后续的write操作"
  - "改进建议：将sinks节点的api.method改为getWriter，并通过arg_index或where条件限制write方法的调用"
  - "缺失了对中间变量赋值传播的处理，原始规则考虑了通过WRITER变量传递的情况"
  - "改进建议：在propagations中添加对FIELD_IDENTIFIER和ASSIGNMENT节点类型的支持"
```
